---Canonical adapter ids: claude-code | opencode | codex | cursor | hermes | codex-agentapi | custom. codex-agentapi is the OpenAI sandbox-provider runtime (DO runs codex exec-server; the agent loop lives at OpenAI) and pairs with the opaque spec.runtime.config block. codex-cli and cursor-cli are deprecated aliases (accepted with a create-time warning). The framework adapters (openai-agents, claude-agent-sdk, crewai, langgraph) are declared but not yet supported; CreateSession rejects them. adapter: custom requires the custom block.
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.AgentManifestSpecRuntime
