---Exactly one form per entry: CATALOG (ref - do.* only, the reserved DO-owned namespace, e.g. do.actions; there is no tenant-registered catalog) or INLINE (name + https url, optional brokered auth - the path for any non-DO server). Mixing forms is a 400. tools entries are individual tool names or toolbelt:<name>[@<int>] group references (catalog refs only) - selection only, disposition stays in spec.permissions. Inline hosts are not auto-allowed for egress - list them under spec.sandbox.egress.allow.
