---Per-metric aggregated pass/fail statistics across all prompts.
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiMetricResultSummary
---@field avg_at_k_percent? number Row-level (not attempt-level) aggregation across epochs for this metric, mirroring EpochResultSummary but scoped to one metric. Only set when the run's epochs > 1; pass_percent/pass_count/etc. above stay attempt-level (over row x epoch pairs) so they don't desynchronize from the counts sitting next to them.
---@field cons_at_k_percent? number
---@field description? string
---@field fail_count? number Rows where the metric failed to score or completed below the threshold.
---@field fail_percent? number
---@field metric_name? string
---@field metric_uuid? string
---@field pass_at_k_percent? number
---@field pass_count? number Rows where the metric completed and passed the configured threshold.
---@field pass_percent? number
---@field skip_percent? number Percentage of rows that were skipped for this metric, computed as skipped_count divided by the total rows the metric saw (pass_count + fail_count + skipped_count).
---@field skipped_count? number Rows where the metric was not evaluated for this prompt.

---Description of a Model
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModel
---@field agreement? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiAgreement
