---@field capabilities? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEndpointCapabilitiesList Capabilities supported by this endpoint (e.g. input_text, output_text, input_image)
---@field endpoint? string The endpoint path (e.g. /chat/responses)

---Capabilities supported by this endpoint (e.g. input_text, output_text, input_image)
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEndpointCapabilitiesList string[]

---Available endpoints and their capabilities
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEndpointsList digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEndpoint[]

---ModelEvaluationEpochAttempt is one epoch's attempt at a dataset row,
---nested under ModelEvaluationResult.epoch_results for multi-epoch runs.
---Carries only the fields that vary per pass — row-identifying fields
---(input/ground_truth/row_number) and candidate_model_name/uuid live once
---on the parent ModelEvaluationResult and aren't repeated here.
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationEpochAttempt
---@field candidate_routed_task? string
---@field metric_results? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationEpochAttemptMetricResultsList Per-metric scores and judge reasoning for this specific pass.
---@field output? string The response from the candidate model for this specific pass.

---Per-metric scores and judge reasoning for this specific pass.
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationEpochAttemptMetricResultsList digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiEvaluationMetricResult[]

---Model Evaluation Preset - a saved, reusable configuration for model
---evaluation runs. Each section (dataset, judge, metrics, candidate, system
---prompt) is independent and may be empty; sections the preset omits must be
---supplied inline on the run that references it. Use `saved_sections` to tell
---"section saved with empty value" apart from "section not saved at all" —
---each section's scalar fields are left empty when the section was not saved.
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationPreset
---@field candidate_inference_config? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiCandidateInferenceConfig
---@field candidate_model_name? string Model slug used to call the candidate model API. Empty when the CANDIDATE section was not saved.
---@field candidate_model_source? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiCandidateModelSource
---@field candidate_model_uuid? string UUID of the candidate model stored on this preset. Empty when the CANDIDATE section was not saved. For DEDICATED candidates this is the dedicated inference deployment UUID.
---@field candidate_system_prompt? string System prompt / instructions to send to the candidate model. Empty when the SYSTEM_PROMPT section was not saved (check `saved_sections`).
---@field created_at? string Timestamp when the preset was created.
---@field dataset_name? string Display name of the dataset stored on this preset. Empty when the DATASET section was not saved or the dataset no longer exists.
---@field dataset_uuid? string UUID of the dataset stored on this preset. Empty when the DATASET section was not saved (check `saved_sections`).
---@field eval_preset_uuid? string UUID of the evaluation preset.
---@field judge_model_name? string Display name of the judge model stored on this preset. Empty when the JUDGE section was not saved or the model no longer exists.
---@field judge_model_uuid? string UUID of the judge model stored on this preset. Empty when the JUDGE section was not saved (check `saved_sections`).
---@field metrics? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationPresetMetricsList Metrics selected for this preset. Empty when the METRICS section was not saved.
---@field name? string Name of the evaluation preset.
---@field saved_sections? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationPresetSavedSectionsList Sections of the inline evaluation config that were persisted when this preset was created. Use this to tell "section was saved with an empty value" apart from "section was not saved" — scalar fields like `dataset_uuid` or `candidate_system_prompt` are always emitted as the empty string when the section was not saved.
---@field star_metric? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiStarMetric

---Metrics selected for this preset. Empty when the METRICS section was not
---saved.
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationPresetMetricsList digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiEvaluationMetric[]

---Sections of the inline evaluation config that were persisted when this
---preset was created. Use this to tell "section was saved with an empty
---value" apart from "section was not saved" — scalar fields like
---`dataset_uuid` or `candidate_system_prompt` are always emitted as the
---empty string when the section was not saved.
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationPresetSavedSectionsList digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiPresetSaveSection[]

---Result for a single prompt in a model evaluation run.
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationResult
---@field candidate_model_name? string
---@field candidate_model_uuid? string
---@field candidate_routed_task? string
---@field epoch? number Which pass over this dataset row produced this result, 1-indexed (1 = first pass). Always 0 (and omitted from JSON) when the run's epochs is 1 (the default) — per-attempt epoch numbering doesn't apply to single-pass runs. When epochs > 1, this always reflects epoch 1 (see epoch_results below).
---@field epoch_results? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationResultEpochResultsMap Present only when the run's epochs > 1: every pass over this row — including epoch 1, duplicated here for convenience — keyed by 1-indexed "epoch1"/"epoch2"/"epoch3" labels. Mirrors the shape of the downloadable results file's epochResults object. The top-level fields above (output, metric_results, candidate_routed_task) always reflect epoch 1, so single-epoch clients reading only those fields see no difference when epochs > 1.
---@field ground_truth? string
---@field input? string The input query sent to the candidate model.
---@field metric_results? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationResultMetricResultsList Per-metric scores and judge reasoning for this prompt.
---@field output? string The response from the candidate model.
---@field row_number? number Which dataset row this result came from. Multiple results share a row_number when epochs > 1: one per pass over that row.

---Present only when the run's epochs > 1: every pass over this row —
---including epoch 1, duplicated here for convenience — keyed by
---1-indexed "epoch1"/"epoch2"/"epoch3" labels. Mirrors the shape of the
---downloadable results file's epochResults object. The top-level fields
---above (output, metric_results, candidate_routed_task) always reflect
---epoch 1, so single-epoch clients reading only those fields see no
---difference when epochs > 1.
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationResultEpochResultsMap { [string]: digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationEpochAttempt }

---Per-metric scores and judge reasoning for this prompt.
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationResultMetricResultsList digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiEvaluationMetricResult[]

