---Metrics selected for this evaluation.
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationRunDetailMetricsList digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiEvaluationMetric[]

---Per-phase progress for a model evaluation run. The candidate phase invokes the
---candidate model once per dataset row; the judge phase scores each
---candidate-success row with the configured metrics. Counts grow as the run
---advances; compare against total_rows to render a progress bar.
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationRunProgress
---@field candidate_rows_evaluated? number Dataset rows whose candidate model call has completed (success or failure).
---@field judge_rows_evaluated? number Candidate-success rows the judge has finished (scored or skipped). Caps at the number of candidate successes, which may be below total_rows.
---@field total_rows? number Total dataset rows for the run, sourced from the evaluation dataset.

---Aggregated result summary for a completed model evaluation run.
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationRunResultSummary
---@field end_time? string
---@field epoch_summary? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiEpochResultSummary
---@field epochs? number Number of times each dataset row was evaluated (n-pass/epochs). Mirrors ModelEvaluationRunDetail.epochs. 1 for every existing run.
---@field metric_summaries? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationRunResultSummaryMetricSummariesList Per-metric aggregated pass/fail statistics.
---@field overall_score_percent? number
---@field per_model_summaries? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiPerModelResultSummaries
---@field per_task_summaries? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiPerTaskResultSummaries
---@field performance_metrics? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiPerformanceMetrics
---@field pricing? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiEvaluationPricing
---@field star_metric_summary? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiStarMetricSummary
---@field start_time? string Run timing.
---@field total_duration_seconds? number Total wall-clock duration in seconds.

---Per-metric aggregated pass/fail statistics.
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelEvaluationRunResultSummaryMetricSummariesList digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiMetricResultSummary[]

