---Performance statistics for a model, computed from canary traffic.
---Present when the feature is enabled. Each metric (ttft, e2e_latency,
---throughput) has its own status.
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelLiveliness
---@field e2e_latency? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelLivelinessMetric
---@field overall_status? string Summary across metrics: "ok" when every metric has data, "partial_data" when some do and some do not, "insufficient_data" when none do.
---@field source? string Traffic the statistics are computed from. Always "canary".
---@field throughput? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelLivelinessMetric
---@field ttft? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelLivelinessMetric

---One UTC day of a performance metric, merged across serving regions.
---Percentiles use the parent metric's unit.
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelLivelinessDay
---@field day_ms? number Start of the day (00:00 UTC) as Unix milliseconds.
---@field p50? number Median value, rounded to 2 decimal places.
---@field p75? number 75th percentile value, rounded to 2 decimal places.
---@field p95? number 95th percentile value, rounded to 2 decimal places.
---@field partial? boolean True while the day is still in progress; its values will keep changing.
---@field samples? number Number of requests the percentiles were computed from.

---One performance metric for a model: its daily series, oldest day first, and
---whether it has data.
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelLivelinessMetric
---@field days? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelLivelinessMetricDaysList Daily points, oldest first. Empty when status is "insufficient_data".
---@field status? string "ok" when days has data; "insufficient_data" when there are not enough recent samples for this model.
---@field unit? string Unit of the percentile values: "s" for ttft and e2e_latency, "tok/s" for throughput.

---Daily points, oldest first. Empty when status is "insufficient_data".
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelLivelinessMetricDaysList digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelLivelinessDay[]

