---A kind of data a model accepts as input or produces as output.
---
--- - MODEL_MODALITY_TEXT: plain text
--- - MODEL_MODALITY_IMAGE: still images
--- - MODEL_MODALITY_AUDIO: audio
--- - MODEL_MODALITY_VIDEO: video
--- - MODEL_MODALITY_EMBEDDING: embedding vectors
--- - MODEL_MODALITY_RANKING: document ranking scores produced by reranking models
--- - MODEL_MODALITY_DECISIONS: structured decisions produced by classification models
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelModality "MODEL_MODALITY_UNSPECIFIED"|"MODEL_MODALITY_TEXT"|"MODEL_MODALITY_IMAGE"|"MODEL_MODALITY_AUDIO"|"MODEL_MODALITY_VIDEO"|"MODEL_MODALITY_EMBEDDING"|"MODEL_MODALITY_RANKING"|"MODEL_MODALITY_DECISIONS"

---Pricing per million tokens (aligns with existing ModelPrice pattern)
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiModelPricing
---@field cache_read_input_price_per_million? number Per-million cache read rate for standard chat models (token_type "cache read input"). Multimodal models use text_cache_read_input_price_per_million / image_cache_read_input_price_per_million instead.
---@field cache_write_1h_input_price_per_million? number Price per million tokens written to the prompt cache with a 1-hour lifetime.
---@field cache_write_5m_input_price_per_million? number Price per million tokens written to the prompt cache with a 5-minute lifetime.
---@field image_cache_read_input_price_per_million? number
---@field image_input_price_per_million? number
---@field image_output_price_per_million? number
---@field input_cache_read? number Cache read input price per single token. Equivalent to cache_read_input_price_per_million.
---@field input_price_per_million? number
---@field output_price_per_million? number
---@field price_per_audio? number
---@field price_per_image? number Unit-based pricing for non-token models (e.g., Fal AI image/video/audio generation, speech models). At most one of these is typically populated per model. Token-based models (chat, embeddings) leave all of these at 0 and populate input_price_per_million / output_price_per_million instead.
---@field price_per_megapixel? number
---@field price_per_second? number
---@field price_per_thousand_characters? number
---@field price_per_video? number
---@field reasoning_price_per_million? number Price per million reasoning tokens. 0 if the model does not charge separately for reasoning tokens.
---@field text_cache_read_input_price_per_million? number
---@field text_input_price_per_million? number Per-million token rates for models that bill text vs image tokens separately (e.g. OpenAI gpt-image-2). Standard chat models leave these at 0 and use input_price_per_million / output_price_per_million instead. Values align with usage token_type / internal/usage.Type string values for each meter.
---@field text_output_price_per_million? number

