---@field enabled boolean A boolean value indicating whether the check is enabled/disabled.

---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.CheckRegionsItem "us_east"|"us_west"|"eu_west"|"se_asia"

---An array containing the selected regions to perform healthchecks from.
