---@field region string The slug identifier for the region where the database cluster is located.
---@field private_network_uuid? string A string specifying the UUID of the VPC to which the database cluster will be assigned. If excluded, the cluster when creating a new database cluster, it will be assigned to your account's default VPC for the region. <br><br>Requires `vpc:read` scope.
---@field tags? digitalocean.digitalocean.CreateDatabaseClusterRequestTagsList|distilled.Null An array of tags (as strings) to apply to the database cluster. <br><br>Requires `tag:create` scope.
