---@field as_archive? boolean Download only. When true, `path` is exported as a tar stream.
---@field size_bytes? number Optional total payload size, as a JSON number. Validated against the maximum staged object size (50 GiB); a larger value returns 413.
---@field sha256? string Optional lowercase hex SHA-256 of the full payload. If set on an upload, it must match on commit.

