---A deletion job that permanently removes Signals conversations for one Harness Runtime environment, or Serverless Inference Signals conversations for a whole team. Aggregated Insights or metrics summaries may still remain.
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.DeletionJob
---@field team_id number The team that owns the deletion job.
---@field deletion_id string The unique identifier for the deletion job (ULID).
---@field type digitalocean.digitalocean.DeletionJobType The scope of the deletion. `agent` deletes Signals conversations for one Harness Runtime environment. `inference` deletes Serverless Inference Signals conversations for the whole team.
---@field agent_id? string The Harness Runtime Environment Config ID (agent UUID) whose conversations are being deleted. Only present for `agent` deletions.
---@field environment_id? string Same as agent_id when present. Dual-emitted during the rename; omitted when agent_id is omitted.
---@field status digitalocean.digitalocean.DeletionJobStatus The current status of the deletion job.
---@field error_message? string|distilled.Null Error message if the deletion failed, or null otherwise.
---@field created_at number Unix timestamp when the deletion job was created.
---@field started_at? number|distilled.Null Unix timestamp when processing started, or null if still queued.
---@field completed_at? number|distilled.Null Unix timestamp when the deletion finished, or null if still in progress.

---The current status of the deletion job.
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.DeletionJobStatus "queued"|"running"|"complete"|"failed"

---The scope of the deletion. `agent` deletes Signals conversations for one Harness Runtime environment. `inference` deletes Serverless Inference Signals conversations for the whole team.
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.DeletionJobType "agent"|"inference"

