---An object specifying domain configurations for a Global load balancer.
---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.Domains
---@field name? string FQDN to associate with a Global load balancer.
---@field is_managed? boolean A boolean value indicating if the domain is already managed by DigitalOcean. If true, all A and AAAA records required to enable Global load balancers will be automatically added.
---@field certificate_id? string The ID of the TLS certificate used for SSL termination.

---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.Droplet
---@field id number A unique identifier for each Droplet instance. This is automatically generated upon Droplet creation.
---@field name string The human-readable name set for the Droplet instance.
---@field memory number Memory of the Droplet in megabytes.
---@field vcpus number The number of virtual CPUs.
---@field disk number The size of the Droplet's disk in gigabytes.
---@field disk_info? digitalocean.digitalocean.DropletDiskInfoList An array of objects containing information about the disks available to the Droplet.
---@field locked boolean A boolean value indicating whether the Droplet has been locked, preventing actions by users.
---@field status digitalocean.digitalocean.DropletStatus A status string indicating the state of the Droplet instance. This may be "new", "active", "off", or "archive".
---@field kernel? digitalocean.digitalocean.Kernel|distilled.Null
---@field created_at string A time value given in ISO8601 combined date and time format that represents when the Droplet was created.
---@field features digitalocean.digitalocean.DropletFeaturesList An array of features enabled on this Droplet.
---@field backup_ids digitalocean.digitalocean.DropletBackupIdsList An array of backup IDs of any backups that have been taken of the Droplet instance. Droplet backups are enabled at the time of the instance creation.<br>Requires `image:read` scope.
---@field next_backup_window digitalocean.digitalocean.DropletNextBackupWindow
---@field snapshot_ids digitalocean.digitalocean.DropletSnapshotIdsList An array of snapshot IDs of any snapshots created from the Droplet instance.<br>Requires `image:read` scope.
---@field image digitalocean.digitalocean.DropletImage
---@field volume_ids digitalocean.digitalocean.DropletVolumeIdsList A flat array including the unique identifier for each Block Storage volume attached to the Droplet.<br>Requires `block_storage:read` scope.
---@field size digitalocean.digitalocean.Size
---@field size_slug string The unique slug identifier for the size of this Droplet.
---@field networks digitalocean.digitalocean.DropletNetworks The details of the network that are configured for the Droplet instance. This is an object that contains keys for IPv4 and IPv6. The value of each of these is an array that contains objects describing an individual IP resource allocated to the Droplet. These will define attributes like the IP address, netmask, and gateway of the specific network depending on the type of network it is.
---@field region digitalocean.digitalocean.Region
---@field tags digitalocean.digitalocean.DropletTagsList An array of Tags the Droplet has been tagged with.<br>Requires `tag:read` scope.
---@field vpc_uuid? string A string specifying the UUID of the VPC to which the Droplet is assigned.<br>Requires `vpc:read` scope.
---@field subnet_uuid? string A string specifying the UUID of the VPC subnet to which the Droplet is assigned.<br>Requires `vpc:read` scope.
---@field gpu_info? digitalocean.digitalocean.GpuInfo

