---@field preloadTools? digitalocean.digitalocean.EndpointConfigPreloadToolsList Tool names, optionally version-pinned, or version-pinned toolbelt references.
---@field outputViews? digitalocean.digitalocean.EndpointConfigOutputViewsMap Maps up to 100 tool slugs to output-view names.
---@field customInstructions? string Instructions for tools in this version.
---@field cache? any
---@field [string] any

---Maps up to 100 tool slugs to output-view names.
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.EndpointConfigOutputViewsMap { [string]: string }

---Tool names, optionally version-pinned, or version-pinned toolbelt references.
