---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.EndpointsListSearchRequest
---@field query string Text matched case-insensitively as a substring of the endpoint name, endpoint ID, actor_id, or agent name. Leading and trailing whitespace is trimmed; an empty query returns 400 invalid_search_query.
---@field actor_id? string Exact actor_id filter, combined with query. Omitted or empty means all actors.
---@field page_size? number Page size; defaults to 20 when omitted. Supplied values outside 1 through 100 return 400. Sizes are not clamped.
---@field page_token? string Opaque next_page_token from the previous response. Omit for the first page. Malformed tokens or replay with a different team, caller visibility, normalized filters, resource kind, or parent endpoint return 400. Tokens contain no full URNs or database row IDs.

