---@field output_encoding? digitalocean.digitalocean.ExecResponseOutputEncoding The encoding of `stdout` and `stderr`, echoing the request's `output_encoding` (or the `utf-8` default).
---@field exit_code number The command's exit code.
---@field truncated? boolean Present and `true` when the output exceeded 4 MiB and was cut off.

