---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.GetInsightTraceRequest
---@field region string The datacenter region slug for the query.
---@field trace_id string The OpenTelemetry trace ID to retrieve, as 32 lowercase hexadecimal characters. IDs are matched exactly; an ID with no spans in the lookup window returns `404`. Malformed or uppercase IDs are not rejected with `400`; they also return `404`.
---@field from? string Start of the trace lookup window. Accepts a relative time (`now`, a bare duration such as `24h` to look back from now, or `now-2h`) or an absolute time (RFC3339, or a Unix epoch integer in seconds, milliseconds, microseconds, or nanoseconds). Defaults to 7 days before now.
---@field to? string End of the trace lookup window, in the same formats as `from`. Defaults to now.

