---@field tags digitalocean.digitalocean.KubernetesNodePoolTagsList An array containing the tags applied to the node pool. All node pools are automatically tagged `k8s`, `k8s-worker`, and `k8s:$K8S_CLUSTER_ID`. <br><br>Requires `tag:read` scope.
---@field labels? any|distilled.Null An object of key/value mappings specifying labels to apply to all nodes in a pool. Labels will automatically be applied to all existing nodes and any subsequent nodes added to the pool. Note that when a label is removed, it is not deleted from the nodes in the pool.
