---@field model_type? digitalocean.digitalocean.ListGenaiModelCatalogRequestModelTypeList Filter by model type. Multiple values use OR semantics. Accepted values: `chat`, `embedding`, `image`, `reasoning`, `coding`, `audio`, `reranking`.
---@field provider? digitalocean.digitalocean.ListGenaiModelCatalogRequestProviderList Filter by model creator/developer. Multiple values use OR semantics. Values are data-driven; use `available_providers` from the response to discover valid options.
---@field availability? digitalocean.digitalocean.ListGenaiModelCatalogRequestAvailabilityList Filter by deployment availability. Multiple values use OR semantics. Accepted values: `serverless`, `dedicated`.
---@field badges? digitalocean.digitalocean.ListGenaiModelCatalogRequestBadgesList Filter by badge. Multiple values use OR semantics. Accepted values: `featured`, `new`, `preview`.
---@field sort_by? digitalocean.digitalocean.ListGenaiModelCatalogRequestSortBy|string Field to sort results by. Default is `MODEL_CATALOG_SORT_BY_CREATED_AT`. - MODEL_CATALOG_SORT_BY_CREATED_AT: Default: sort by creation date. - MODEL_CATALOG_SORT_BY_NAME: Sort by the model's display name (case-insensitive). - MODEL_CATALOG_SORT_BY_PRICE: Sort by input token price.
---@field per_page? number Number of items per page. Replaces the deprecated `limit` field.
---@field sort_direction? digitalocean.digitalocean.ListGenaiModelCatalogRequestSortDirection|string Sort direction. Defaults to descending when unspecified.
---@field use_case? digitalocean.digitalocean.ListGenaiModelCatalogRequestUseCase|string Filter by pre-defined use case. When unspecified, no use-case filter is applied. Accepted values: `MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_CODING`, `MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_AGENTS`, `MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_AUDIO`, `MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_IMAGE`, `MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_EMBEDDING`, `MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_VIDEO`. - MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_UNSPECIFIED: No use-case filter applied; return all models. - MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_CODING: Coding-optimized models: model_type = coding, or usecases include coding, agentic_coding, or code_generation. - MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_AGENTS: Agent-building models: usecases include tool_calling, agentic, agent_platform, agentic_workflows, or agentic_coding. - MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_AUDIO: Audio models: model_type is audio, or usecases include audio, text_to_speech, or voice_cloning, or output modalities include audio. - MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_IMAGE: Image models: model_type is image, or usecases include image_generation, text_to_image, or ideogram, or output modalities include image. - MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_VIDEO: Video models: usecases include video_generation or text_to_video, or output modalities include video. - MODEL_CATALOG_USE_CASE_EMBEDDING: Embedding and reranking models: model_type is embedding or reranking, or usecases include vectorization or reranking.

---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.ListGenaiModelCatalogRequestAvailabilityList string[]

