---@field port? number|distilled.Null The port for SRV records.
---@field ttl? number This value is the time to live for the record, in seconds. This defines the time frame that clients can cache queried information before a refresh should be requested.
---@field weight? number|distilled.Null The weight for SRV records.
---@field flags? number|distilled.Null An unsigned integer between 0-255 used for CAA records.
---@field tag? string|distilled.Null The parameter tag for CAA records. Valid values are "issue", "issuewild", or "iodef"

---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.PatchDomainRecordResponse
---@field domain_record digitalocean.digitalocean.DomainRecord

