---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.PermissionRule
---@field tool string Tool taxonomy this rule matches (e.g. bash, file.read, file.write, web.fetch, git.*, mcp).
---@field match? digitalocean.digitalocean.PermissionRuleMatchMap Optional keys narrowing the rule (e.g. {"command": "npm run deploy"} for bash). Values are globs and must not contain shell-style ${VAR}/$VAR expansions.
---@field action digitalocean.digitalocean.PermissionRuleAction
---@field enforcement? digitalocean.digitalocean.PermissionRuleEnforcement What happens when the agent cannot enforce the rule exactly. "strict" rejects the session; "best-effort" degrades to the closest more-restrictive form and warns (never widens). Defaults to strict for deny rules, best-effort otherwise.

---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.PermissionRuleAction "allow"|"ask"|"deny"

---What happens when the agent cannot enforce the rule exactly. "strict" rejects the session; "best-effort" degrades to the closest more-restrictive form and warns (never widens). Defaults to strict for deny rules, best-effort otherwise.
