---@field rules? digitalocean.digitalocean.PermissionsRulesList Ordered match→action rules. Declared order is authoritative: the LAST matching rule wins (author-order last-match).
---@field filesystem? digitalocean.digitalocean.PermissionFilesystem
---@field network? digitalocean.digitalocean.PermissionNetwork

---Disposition for tool calls that match no rule. Defaults to "ask" when omitted.
