---@field environment_id? string The environment whose data should be exported. For Harness Runtime, this is the Environment Config ID. Required when `type` is `agent` if `agent_id` is omitted; must be omitted when `type` is `inference`. Prefer this over `agent_id`.
---@field agent_id? string Deprecated alias for `environment_id`. Accepted for backward compatibility; must equal `environment_id` when both are set. Both set and different returns 400. Required when `type` is `agent` if `environment_id` is omitted; must be omitted when `type` is `inference`.
---@field signal_type? digitalocean.digitalocean.SignalsCreateExportRequestSignalTypeList Filter the export to only include the specified signal types. Use the export options endpoint to list available values.
---@field session_ids? digitalocean.digitalocean.SignalsCreateExportRequestSessionIdsList Optional list of specific session IDs to include in the export.
---@field start_time? string Include only sessions that started at or after this timestamp.
---@field end_time? string Include only sessions that started at or before this timestamp.

