---@field type digitalocean.digitalocean.SystemoneAnswerType Echoes the `type` of the question this answer corresponds to.
---@field noul? number Present when the question type is `noul`. A truth-likelihood value.
---@field choice? string Present when the question type is `choice`. The selected option name from the question's `criteria` map.
---@field score? number Present when the question type is `score`. The numeric position along the ordered rubric levels supplied in the question's `criteria`.
---@field legend? digitalocean.digitalocean.SystemoneAnswerLegendMap Present when the question type is `score`. Maps rubric levels to their corresponding numeric positions.
