---@field model_router_uuid? string
---@field model_uuid? string Identifier for the foundation model.
---@field name? string Agent name
---@field open_ai_key_uuid? string Optional OpenAI key uuid for use with OpenAI models
---@field project_id? string The id of the DigitalOcean project this agent will belong to
---@field provide_citations? boolean
---@field reasoning_effort? string
---@field retrieval_method? digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiRetrievalMethod|string
---@field router_preset_slug? string
---@field tags? digitalocean.digitalocean.UpdateGenaiAgentRequestTagsList A set of abitrary tags to organize your agent
---@field temperature? number Controls the model’s creativity, specified as a number between 0 and 1. Lower values produce more predictable and conservative responses, while higher values encourage creativity and variation.
---@field thinking_token_budget? number
---@field top_p? number Defines the cumulative probability threshold for word selection, specified as a number between 0 and 1. Higher values allow for more diverse outputs, while lower values ensure focused and coherent responses.
---@field web_fetch_enabled? boolean Optional. Set to true to let the agent use the built-in web_fetch tool to retrieve content from public web pages, or false to disable it.
---@field web_search_enabled? boolean Optional. Set to true to let the agent use the built-in web_search tool to search the public web for current information, or false to disable it.

