---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.UpdateHarnessSessionRequest
---@field session_id string The session UUID.
---@field resume_on_topoff? boolean When present, sets whether this session opts in to automatic resumption when the team's prepayment balance is restored after a low-balance pause. Session-scoped consent, not config-scoped. Omitted properties are not modified. Cannot be combined with `manifest_yaml`.
---@field manifest_yaml? string A partial manifest, as YAML, holding only the sections to change: `tools`, `env`, `secrets`. Absent sections are untouched; any other top-level key is 400, and `model` / `permissions` return 501. `tools` is the full replacement list (`tools: []` detaches every MCP server; `tools: null` is 400). `env` and `secrets` are full sets: a key left out is removed. A secret value is a string (set or rotate) or `{}` (keep the current value); per-key `null` is 400. Platform and framework keys and non-plain secrets must be sent back unchanged, or the request is 422. Cannot be combined with `resume_on_topoff`. Requires the team to be enrolled in the config-update feature (403 otherwise).

