---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.UpdateKubernetesNodePoolRequest
---@field cluster_id string A unique ID that can be used to reference a Kubernetes cluster.
---@field node_pool_id string A unique ID that can be used to reference a Kubernetes node pool.
---@field name string A human-readable name for the node pool.
