---@field tags? digitalocean.digitalocean.UpdateKubernetesNodePoolRequestTagsList An array containing the tags applied to the node pool. All node pools are automatically tagged `k8s`, `k8s-worker`, and `k8s:$K8S_CLUSTER_ID`. <br><br>Requires `tag:read` scope.
---@field labels? any|distilled.Null An object of key/value mappings specifying labels to apply to all nodes in a pool. Labels will automatically be applied to all existing nodes and any subsequent nodes added to the pool. Note that when a label is removed, it is not deleted from the nodes in the pool.
---@field taints? digitalocean.digitalocean.UpdateKubernetesNodePoolRequestTaintsList An array of taints to apply to all nodes in a pool. Taints will automatically be applied to all existing nodes and any subsequent nodes added to the pool. When a taint is removed, it is deleted from all nodes in the pool.
---@field auto_scale? boolean A boolean value indicating whether auto-scaling is enabled for this node pool.
---@field min_nodes? number The minimum number of nodes that this node pool can be auto-scaled to. The value will be `0` if `auto_scale` is set to `false`.
---@field max_nodes? number The maximum number of nodes that this node pool can be auto-scaled to. The value will be `0` if `auto_scale` is set to `false`.

---An array containing the tags applied to the node pool. All node pools are automatically tagged `k8s`, `k8s-worker`, and `k8s:$K8S_CLUSTER_ID`. <br><br>Requires `tag:read` scope.
