---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.UserSettings
---@field pg_allow_replication? boolean For PostgreSQL clusters, set to `true` to grant the user replication privileges. When omitted on create or update, the value defaults to `false` and replication privileges are not granted. This option is not currently supported for other database engines.
---@field opensearch_acl? digitalocean.digitalocean.UserSettingsOpensearchAclList ACLs (Access Control Lists) specifying permissions on index within a OpenSearch cluster.
---@field acl? digitalocean.digitalocean.UserSettingsAclList ACLs (Access Control Lists) specifying permissions on topics within a Kafka cluster.
---@field mongo_user_settings? digitalocean.digitalocean.UserSettingsMongoUserSettings MongoDB-specific settings for the user. Configure these when creating a user. Updating MongoDB roles or database access after creation is not supported; recreate the user to change them. This option is not currently supported for other database engines.

---@class digitalocean.digitalocean.UserSettingsAclItem
---@field id? string An identifier for the ACL. Will be computed after the ACL is created/updated.
---@field topic string A regex for matching the topic(s) that this ACL should apply to.
---@field permission digitalocean.digitalocean.UserSettingsAclItemPermission|string Permission set applied to the ACL. 'consume' allows for messages to be consumed from the topic. 'produce' allows for messages to be published to the topic. 'produceconsume' allows for both 'consume' and 'produce' permission. 'admin' allows for 'produceconsume' as well as any operations to administer the topic (delete, update).

---Permission set applied to the ACL. 'consume' allows for messages to be consumed from the topic. 'produce' allows for messages to be published to the topic. 'produceconsume' allows for both 'consume' and 'produce' permission. 'admin' allows for 'produceconsume' as well as any operations to administer the topic (delete, update).
---@alias digitalocean.digitalocean.UserSettingsAclItemPermission "admin"|"consume"|"produce"|"produceconsume"

