---@field bearer_token? digitalocean.digitalocean.WebhookBearerToken
---@field headers? digitalocean.digitalocean.WebhookNotificationConfigHeadersMap Optional custom HTTP headers to include on webhook deliveries. At most 20 headers are allowed. Reserved header names such as `host`, `content-type`, and `proxy-*` are rejected.
---@field signature? digitalocean.digitalocean.WebhookSignatureConfig

