---
---`DELETE /v2/gen-ai/workspaces/{workspace_uuid}`
---Errors: NotFound.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.DeleteGenaiWorkspaceRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.ApiDeleteWorkspaceOutput? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_genai_workspace(input) end

---Soft-delete an Environment Config.
---
---Releases the active team-scoped name; the config row is retained (soft delete), so sessions created from it keep a resolvable config_id.
---
---`DELETE /v2/agents/configs/{config_id}`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound, Conflict.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.DeleteHarnessConfigRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.DeleteHarnessConfigResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_harness_config(input) end

---Revoke a provider connection.
---
---Revokes the connection and returns it. A connection that an environment config still uses is left in place and the error names those configs. There is no force flag on this route. A connection under a different provider than `{provider}` is 404. No token is returned.
---
---`DELETE /v2/agents/auth/{provider}/connections/{connection_id}`
---Errors: NotFound, Conflict.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.DeleteHarnessProviderConnectionRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.ProviderConnectionResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_harness_provider_connection(input) end

---DestroySession tears down the sandbox and marks the session DESTROYED.
---
---Persistent workspace contents are retained per tenant policy. A persistent workspace the session holds is saved and kept: it goes to `RELEASING` while the files are saved and then back to `AVAILABLE`. Creating a session on that workspace returns `409` until it is `AVAILABLE` again. Returns 204 No Content on success.
---
---`DELETE /v2/agents/sessions/{session_id}`
---Errors: Forbidden, NotFound.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.DeleteHarnessSessionRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.DeleteHarnessSessionResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_harness_session(input) end

---DeleteCheckpoint removes a checkpoint and its underlying machine-state capture.
---
---Idempotent: deleting an already-gone checkpoint still returns 200. Removes the DB row and the substrate checkpoint.
---
---`DELETE /v2/agents/sessions/{session_id}/checkpoints/{checkpoint_id}`
---Errors: Forbidden, NotFound.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.DeleteHarnessSessionCheckpointRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.DeleteCheckpointResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_harness_session_checkpoint(input) end

---DeleteTemplate deletes a team custom template.
---
---Global templates cannot be deleted via this API.
---
---`DELETE /v2/agents/templates/{template_id}`
---Errors: NotFound.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.DeleteHarnessTemplateRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.DeleteTemplateResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_harness_template(input) end

---Delete a persistent workspace.
---
---Permanently deletes a persistent workspace and its files. Only a workspace that is `AVAILABLE` or `FAILED` can be deleted; remove the session that holds it first. Workspaces are never deleted automatically.
---
---`DELETE /v2/agents/workspaces/{workspace_id}`
---Errors: Forbidden, NotFound, Conflict.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.DeleteHarnessWorkspaceRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.DeleteHarnessWorkspaceResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_harness_workspace(input) end

