---Search Session Tools
---
---Finds the catalog tools that fit one or more use cases. This is the REST form of the `action_search` MCP tool. Each query is searched independently and returns its own result group, so you can see which tools serve which goal. Results include each tool's `inputSchema`, so you can call a tool with `POST /tools/invoke` without another lookup.
---
---Results include only tools that the session can call. If the session policy requires approval for `action_search`, the response is a failed result with `_meta.status` set to `requires_approval`.
---
---`POST /tools/search`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.GatewayToolsListSearchRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.GatewayToolsListSearchResponse? value
