---Get Database MySQL CPU Usage Metrics
---
---Retrieve CPU usage (percent) for a MySQL cluster. Response is a time series of cluster-level CPU usage. Use **aggregate** to get avg, max, or min over the range.
---
---`GET /v2/monitoring/metrics/database/mysql/cpu_usage`
---Errors: NotFound.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.GetMonitoringDatabaseMysqlCpuUsageRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.Metrics2? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_monitoring_database_mysql_cpu_usage(input) end

