---Errors: NotFound.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.GetMonitoringDatabaseMysqlDiskUsageRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.Metrics2? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_monitoring_database_mysql_disk_usage(input) end

---Get Database MySQL Load Average Metrics
---
---Retrieve load metrics for a MySQL cluster. Use **metric** for the window: **load1** (1-minute), **load5** (5-minute), or **load15** (15-minute). Use **aggregate** to get either the average (avg) or maximum (max) over that window over the time range.
---
---`GET /v2/monitoring/metrics/database/mysql/load`
---Errors: NotFound.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.GetMonitoringDatabaseMysqlLoadRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.Metrics2? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_monitoring_database_mysql_load(input) end

