---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.HarnessGetTriggerBySessionRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.GetTriggerResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:harness_get_trigger_by_session(input) end

---GetTriggerExecution returns a single execution, including its payload.
---
---Returns the full execution row, including the `payload`, `output_text`, and `output_truncated` fields omitted from list items.
---
---`GET /v2/agents/triggers/{trigger_id}/executions/{execution_id}`
---Errors: NotFound.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.HarnessGetTriggerExecutionRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.GetTriggerExecutionResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:harness_get_trigger_execution(input) end

---ListTriggerExecutions returns a trigger's execution history.
---
---Keyset-paginated. The large `payload` field is omitted from list items; fetch a single execution to read it.
