---Update an Endpoint
---
---Renames an endpoint, changes its Insights consent, or both, without changing its owner, actor, or versions. Send name, insights, or both. Insights merges per signal: a metrics, logs, or traces value of true or false replaces that signal, and an omitted signal keeps its stored value. The consent applies to every version, including pinned and older versions. A body with no name and no insights signal returns 400 endpoint_update_empty. Only the endpoint owner may update it. An invalid name returns 400 invalid_endpoint_name; a duplicate team name returns 409 endpoint_name_taken. Inaccessible endpoints return 404 endpoint_not_found.
---
---`PATCH /v2/action-gateway/endpoints/{endpoint_id}`
---Errors: BadRequest, NotFound, Conflict.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.PatchEndpointRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.EndpointResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:patch_endpoint(input) end

