---Start a fresh login for an existing connection.
---
---Resumes a pending connection's authorization, or starts a new one for an expired or revoked connection. The connection keeps its id, `user_id`, and scopes, so environments that use it keep working once it is active again. An active connection is returned unchanged. Only the member who owns the connection can reconnect it; for anyone else the response is `404`, the same as for an unknown connection. The response includes `authorization` while the interactive step is outstanding. No token is returned.
---
---`POST /v2/agents/auth/{provider}/connections/{connection_id}/reconnect`
---Errors: NotFound.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.PostHarnessProviderConnectionReconnectRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.ProviderConnectionResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:post_harness_provider_connection_reconnect(input) end

---ResolveHITL records the user's decision on a pending HITL request.
---
---harness-api forwards the decision into the owning microVM via the inbound runtime.v1.OHR.ResolveHITL RPC (dialed through the guest-fronting proxy), which unblocks the gated agent action. The resolution is also echoed to all attached clients as a HITLResolved event on StreamSession. Returns 204 No Content on success.
---
---`POST /v2/agents/sessions/{session_id}/hitl/{request_id}`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.PostHarnessSessionHitlRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.PostHarnessSessionHitlResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:post_harness_session_hitl(input) end

---PauseSession freezes the session's microVM sandbox.
---
---Supported on microvm-substrate sessions only; dewdrop/docker sessions return 501 Not Implemented. Paused sessions count against quota. Clients learn state via GetSession/ListSessions; no live session.updated event is emitted.
---
---`POST /v2/agents/sessions/{session_id}/pause`
---Errors: Forbidden, NotFound, Conflict.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.PostHarnessSessionPauseRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.PostHarnessSessionPauseResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:post_harness_session_pause(input) end

