---
---`PUT /v2/registries/{registry_name}/garbage-collection/{garbage_collection_uuid}`
---Errors: NotFound.
---@param input digitalocean.digitalocean.UpdateRegistryGarbageCollectionRequest
---@return digitalocean.digitalocean.UpdateRegistryGarbageCollectionResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_registry_garbage_collection(input) end

